{"id":"casualidad","lemma":"casualidad","pos":"noun","rank":1652,"glosses":["chance, coincidence, happenstance, fluke, accident"],"ipa":"/kaswaliˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"casualidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-casualidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"La encontré por casualidad.","en":"I found it by chance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455320"},{"text":"Por alguna de esas casualidades, ¿tiene una aspirina?","en":"Do you by any chance have some aspirin?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594323"},{"text":"¡Qué casualidad encontrarte aquí!","en":"Fancy meeting you here!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514909"},{"text":"Solo fue una casualidad.","en":"It was just an accident.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152090"},{"text":"Sucedió completamente por casualidad.","en":"It happened completely by accident.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152079"}]}